2743733, "avatar": "411e78719fa3fc49069e2ddc712e2c3b76bfc092"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a retro scifi LfD with modern controls.", "timestamp_created": 1732743767, "timestamp_updated": 1732743767, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179926007", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045710772", "personaname": "ColeCaine", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MankindCantgothere/", "num_games_owned": 692, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 544, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 544, "last_played": 1776141187, "avatar": "dca6709a89d0d3575e69712fa6d3e116b3b84a6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Solid team shooter, with stand out design made by a passionate team.", "timestamp_created": 1732730548, "timestamp_updated": 1732730548, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179788189", "author": {"steamid": "76561198388191932", "personaname": "LowTierLock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WatchTheJet/", "num_games_owned": 253, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 333, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 313, "deck_playtime_at_review": 39, "last_played": 1752239506, "avatar": "6afbc308fe3d546ee1b1d2953dc820a12d0ef842"}, "language": "english", "review": "Performance differs, runs well on the Steam Deck at a consistent 60 fps if you turn everything to low.\r\nHoping they fix the fps drop that happens when a horde appears on screen.\r\n\r\nApart from that, is good game 👍\r\nJust don't buy it expecting to instantly find a match, it's a tiny TINY player base so you're better off going into the Discord server to find people to play with.\r\nSingleplayer experience is decent as well, the bots will get stuck on stuff but they'll just teleport if their pathing doesn't unstuck them.", "timestamp_created": 1732540731, "timestamp_updated": 1732540731, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179267673", "author": {"steamid": "76561197977063461", "personaname": "the_inner_tummy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197977063461/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 21, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21, "last_played": 1728873658, "avatar": "c01bf5f9a28149d7fb91904a51bda1d7cbc88ff6"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDIT: Just learned.... Turns out the head honcho behind this game, Chet Faliszek, is against the \"Stop Killing Games\" movement. No wonder he is an infamous figure. More reason to not buy this game, nobody plays it and Chet might decide to take away the game from people who play it too.\n\nI love Valve but shame on them for rigging the reviews. They've made it so the average review score is only counting reviewers that bought the game off Steam. So if you bought outside of Steam it doesn't count your review towards the average. Even with the reviews being rigged it's still at Mixed. I would not spend $10 maybe $1 at most (and make sure you have friends to play with! Game is dead). Even then it's better to play L4D instead.\n\nTries to be Left 4 Dead but unfortunately fails to match its inspiration. Nice idea totally failed at execution unfortunately. All the playable characters feel.... bland... without character. In L4D each character had a lot of personality and you could tell what kind of role they filled (Coach is a school gym teacher, Nick is some sort of criminal, Bill is a war vet, Rochelle is a news reporter, etc.) but in this game they all look like random NPC people certainly not main characters.\n\nThere's a lot of small, and big, things that add up to making this a far worse experience; things you'll appreciate L4D more for. No more bashing enemies with your m2 to handle hordes. You can get easily lost in the maps (they can be very confusing). Things in the world don't feel like they have weight and you can't destroy objects like you could in L4D. Weapons don't feel as good. No facial animations really, whole game feels like an early build not a finished product.\n\nIt's odd because people who worked on L4D worked on this game yet it's missing so much of what made L4D great. It has some of the ingredients but.... just needs way more polish, way more time in the oven. You'd need an overhaul and based on the updates this game (hasn't) received I'd say that won't happen. I know game development is tough but unfortunately this one just didn't succeed.\n\nI sat on this review for awhile but after talking with a friend about the game I felt it was worth posting the review.", "timestamp_created": 1731884011, "timestamp_updated": 1768435587, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.423336148262023926", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179238325", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045782051", "personaname": "Aiyciee", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IyseAyce/", "num_games_owned": 792, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 120, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 120, "last_played": 1731848171, "avatar": "d4cd10d6b5dade14fd415bdfbd6c187ff2685fa4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sorry Chet but this is not the next left 4 dead.\n\nFlasher also hurt my RETINA.\n\nI'm picking a sample and I'm dropping it.", "timestamp_created": 1731855115, "timestamp_updated": 1731855115, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505100011825561523", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "178830689", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018387002", "personaname": "Pixel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PxlHeart/", "num_games_owned": 186, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 225, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 174, "last_played": 1731624854, "avatar": "9874f3364db95eaf9581206f0776b8b5b0b749dc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really fun game, the gunplay and the loop are both very satisfying", "timestamp_created": 1731339445, "timestamp_updated": 1731339445, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498812347650527954", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178734535", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015771285", "personaname": "OTTER", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Adragonontheinternet/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 756, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 53, "last_played": 1779144187, "avatar": "b3d035e0236a8ebd